OL,3,GNEWSAHalf of Cornwall's rubbish could
OL,4,Astill be recycled
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Loic Rich, cabinet member
OL,7,Fwith responsibility for Environment and
OL,8,FClimate Change at Cornwall Council,
OL,9,Fsaid people in the county were
OL,10,Frecycling "more than ever before" but
OL,11,Fstressed there was "more work to be
OL,12,Fdone".
